  "key": "QP-2890",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "Implement conversational Quest creation and management",
    "description": "## User story\n\nAs a QP developer, when publishing the Quest skill, I want users to create, list, inspect and edit quests through natural language, including configuration of an existing Web3 reward.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n* The agent asks for missing required values and constructs valid requests.\n* Create/list/view/edit journeys succeed against the verified contract.\n* Edits preserve unrelated quest fields and are confirmed through readback.\n* Unsupported conditions, invalid inputs and API errors receive actionable responses.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nQuest deletion, Web Shop UI and new reward infrastructure.",
