content.text:
{
  "expand": "renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations",
  "id": "3154341",
  "self": "https://api.atlassian.com/ex/jira/9dfc393f-ac2d-4cef-8b1c-0657da26067f/rest/api/3/issue/3154341",
  "key": "QP-2860",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "[4.2] Project scope resolution with uniform-404 semantics",
    "description": "**Plan task 4.2** · Depends on: 4.1 · Blocks: 4.5\n\nUnknown, un-onboarded and unauthorized projects must be indistinguishable. Project IDs are trivially enumerable, so any difference between the three turns a publisher endpoint into an oracle for QP's customer list.\n\nOrdering matters independently: the local lookup runs **before** any outbound vendor call, so enumeration attempts terminate in QP and never consume Xsolla's rate limit. With no validation cache in this MVP, that ordering is the only thing keeping probe traffic off the vendor.\n\n* \\[ \\] `resolveProjectScope(ctx, projectID) (accountID, merchantID, error)` — one indexed read on `accounts.xsolla_project_id`, returning a single sentinel error for all three negative cases.\n* \\[ \\] HTTP layer renders all three identically: same status, same body, no differing headers.\n* \\[ \\] Log the real reason server-side with a distinguishing `ACTION` value, so operators can tell them apart and each case stays separately measurable.\n* \\[ \\] Test asserting the vendor client is **not** called for an unmapped project. This is a cost and rate-limit property, so it needs a test rather than a convention.\n* \\[ \\] Test: all three negative cases produce byte-identical responses.\n\n",
    "status": {
      "self": "https://api.atlassian.com/ex/jira/9dfc393f-ac2d-4cef-8b1c-0657da26067f/rest/api/3/status/18738",
      "description": "",
      "iconUrl": "https://api.atlassian.com/ex/jira/9dfc393f-ac2d-4cef-8b1c-0657da26067f/",
      "name": "К выполнению",
      "id": "18738",
      "statusCategory": {
        "self": "https://api.atlassian.com/ex/jira/9dfc393f-ac2d-4cef-8b1c-0657da26067f/rest/api/3/statuscategory/2",
        "id": 2,
        "key": "new",
        "colorName": "blue-gray",
        "name": "К выполнению"
      }
    }
  }
}

